Package: unbiasedgoodness
Title: Goodness-of-Fit Tests After Model Selection
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: 
    person("Joshua", "Loftus", , "joftius@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2905-1632"))
Description: Provides goodness-of-fit tests for linear models chosen by
    data-driven model selection. Typical model diagnostics are biased when
    computed on the same data used to select the model. The package tests a
    selected model against a data-driven enlargement of it, either with
    selective (truncated) F and chi tests after forward stepwise selection,
    or with residual prediction tests after lasso selection, and includes
    tools for simulating the selective error rates of these tests.
